"privileges reported in MORPH-6016 as ``Clone``, ``Direct``, and "
"``AccessMigrate``. The report established that adding the set restored "
"hypervisor-console access for a discovered Windows 11 vTPM VM; it did not"
" isolate which individual privilege the console session consumed. Treat "
"the set as a reported requirement for workflows that include console "
"access, clone, or migration of encrypted/vTPM VMs, not as a requirement "
"for every unencrypted VM."
